---@field actionList? aws.personalize_runtime.ActionList A list of action recommendations sorted in descending order by prediction score. There can be a maximum of 100 actions in the list. For information about action scores, see How action recommendation scoring works.
---@field recommendationId? aws.personalize_runtime.RecommendationID The ID of the recommendation.

