---@field metadataColumns? aws.personalize_runtime.MetadataColumns If you enabled metadata in recommendations when you created or updated the campaign, specify metadata columns from your Items dataset to include in the personalized ranking. The map key is ITEMS and the value is a list of column names from your Items dataset. The maximum number of columns you can provide is 10.

